  "hints": [
    "The pad is in a side nook that only LAB-LIGHTS lights. The generator cannot run LAB-LIGHTS and LIFT-POWER together (40 and 50 is more than 60).",
    "You cannot end a turn in the dark, but your echo can. Light the nook to record a walk into it, then swap the power before you launch.",
    "Record right, right, up and wait. Switch LAB-LIGHTS off and LIFT-POWER on, launch with {key:echo}, then go right twice, wait once and go right twice."
  ],
  "tutorial_steps": [
    {
      "id": "console",
      "concept": true,
      "title": "Only your echo can stand in the dark",
      "explanation": "A pad sits in a side nook that only LAB-LIGHTS lights, and the lift needs LIFT-POWER. The generator cannot run both (40 and 50 is more than 60). You cannot end a turn in the dark, but your echo can. Light the nook first, to record a walk into it.",
      "objective": "Press {key:console} to open the power console.",
      "action": "open_console",
      "expected": {
        "console": true
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "position": [
          3,
          4
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "switch-lab-lights",
      "objective": "Press {key:nav_prev} or {key:nav_next} to select LAB-LIGHTS, then {key:toggle} to switch it on (40 units).",
      "action": "toggle",
      "expected": {
        "pending": [
          "lab-lights"
        ]
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "circuit",
        "id": "lab-lights"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "apply-lights",
      "objective": "Press {key:apply} to close the console. The nook and the route are lit.",
      "action": "apply",
      "expected": {
        "powered": [
          "lab-lights"
        ],
        "console": false
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "power"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record",
      "objective": "Press {key:echo} to start recording.",
      "action": "enter",
      "expected": {
        "phase": "recording",
        "recorded": 0
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "timeline",
        "index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record-first",
      "objective": "Press {key:move_right} to walk onto the floor.",
      "action": "right",
      "expected": {
        "player": [
          4,
          4
        ],
        "recorded": 1
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "position": [
          4,
          4
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record-second",
      "objective": "Press {key:move_right} to reach the tile below the nook.",
      "action": "right",
      "expected": {
        "player": [
          5,
          4
        ],
        "recorded": 2
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "position": [
          5,
          4
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record-nook",
      "objective": "Press {key:move_up} to step onto the pad in the nook.",
      "action": "up",
      "expected": {
        "player": [
          5,
          3
        ],
        "recorded": 3,
        "active_pad": "pad-a"
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "position": [
          5,
          3
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record-wait",
      "objective": "Press {key:wait} to save a wait, so your echo stays on the pad a little longer.",
      "action": "wait",
      "expected": {
        "player": [
          5,
          3
        ],
        "recorded": 4
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "timeline",
        "index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "commit",
      "objective": "Press {key:echo} to save the recording. You return to the entrance.",
      "action": "enter",
      "expected": {
        "phase": "committed",
        "recorded": 4,
        "player": [
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "state"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "swap",
      "concept": true,
      "title": "Swap the lights for the lift",
      "explanation": "The nook is about to go dark, which your echo does not mind. Switch the lights off and the lift on (50 of 60 units). You will walk the lit route while your echo holds the pad in the dark.",
      "objective": "Press {key:console} to open the power console.",
      "action": "open_console",
      "expected": {
        "console": true
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "position": [
          3,
          4
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lights-off",
      "objective": "Select LAB-LIGHTS, then press {key:toggle} to switch it off.",
      "action": "toggle",
      "expected": {
        "pending": []
      },
      "target": {
        "kind": "circuit",
        "id": "lab-lights"
      }
    },
    {
